import json
with open('/private/var/folders/tv/yzyl0n517xj5v54fgn0c0j3h0000gn/T/e2e-wilkins-marriage-fogo81yx/tree.gedcomx.json') as f:
    tree = json.load(f)
for p in tree.get('persons', []):
    if p.get('id') == 'I1':
        print('I1 names:')
        for n in p.get('names', []):
            print(f\"  {n.get('id')}: {n.get('nameForms', [{}])[0].get('fullText', '?')} preferred={n.get('preferred', False)}\")
        print('I1 facts:')
        for fct in p.get('facts', [])[:5]:
            print(f\"  {fct.get('id')}: type={fct.get('type','?')} primary={fct.get('primary',False)} val={fct.get('value','?')} date={fct.get('date',{}).get('original','')}\")
        break
# Also check R22
for r in tree.get('relationships', []):
    if r.get('id') == 'R22':
        print('R22:', json.dumps(r, indent=2))
        break
"

